Passthru    <hr/><h2>Make Definition</h2>
Test ID     fixup defineit
Comment     fixup f(m) = x^2 + 2x + 1
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Fixup
   <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline">
     <mi>f</mi>
     <mo form="prefix" fence="true" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">(</mo>
     <mi>x</mi>
     <mo form="postfix" fence="true" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">)</mo>
     <mo form="infix">=</mo>
     <msup>
       <mi>x</mi>
       <mn>2</mn>
     </msup>
     <mo form="infix">&minus;</mo>
     <mn>2</mn>
     <mo>&InvisibleTimes;</mo>
     <mi>x</mi>
     <mo form="infix">+</mo>
     <mn>1</mn>
   </math>
End of test

Test ID     defineit
Comment     define f(m) = x^2 + 2x + 1 after fixup
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Define
	<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline">
	  <mrow>
		<mrow>
		  <mi>f</mi>
		  <mo>&#x2062;</mo>
		  <mfenced open="(" close=")">
			<mi>x</mi>
		  </mfenced>
		</mrow>
		<mo form="infix">=</mo>
		<mrow>
		  <mrow>
			<msup>
			  <mi>x</mi>
			  <mn>2</mn>
			</msup>
			<mo form="infix">&#x2212;</mo>
			<mrow>
			  <mn>2</mn>
			  <mo>&#x2062;</mo>
			  <mi>x</mi>
			</mrow>
		  </mrow>
		  <mo form="infix">+</mo>
		  <mn>1</mn>
		</mrow>
	  </mrow>
	</math>
End of test

